/ locals: current_server
.card
  .card-body.text-center.py-5
    i.bi.bi-arrow-up-circle.display-4.text-warning.mb-3.d-block
    h4.mb-2 This server needs updating
    p.text-muted.mx-auto style="max-width: 34rem;"
      | #{current_server.server_id} is running an older version of ESM than these pages are built for. Everything here
        talks to the server in ways it doesn't understand yet, so there's nothing it can do until it's on
        #{ServerVersion::MINIMUM_SERVER_VERSION} or newer.

    - if server_manageable?(current_server)
      .d-flex.gap-2.justify-content-center.flex-wrap
        = link_to "/docs/server_setup", class: "btn btn-primary"
          i.bi.bi-book.me-1
          | How to update
    - else
      p.text-muted.small.mb-0 Let the server's admins know.
